WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.000
(stand-in voice) Dulu ada kancil yang pintar...

2
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.489
That's a kid's story.

3
00:00:12.489 --> 00:00:17.190
Ninety seconds of talking, performed back as wayang kulit.

4
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.585
Then the gara-gara.

5
00:00:30.585 --> 00:00:33.745
The show pauses and the whole class votes

6
00:00:33.745 --> 00:00:36.510
on their phones for what happens next.

7
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.781
Then the child takes the puppets.

8
00:00:59.781 --> 00:01:02.955
In Kelir Live they're on a lamp-lit screen.

9
00:01:02.955 --> 00:01:07.320
Drag them, tilt them, tap the gunungan for the next scene.

10
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.143
Wayang kulit is a thousand years old.

11
00:01:18.143 --> 00:01:20.887
With Dalang AI, any child can sit

12
00:01:20.887 --> 00:01:23.630
behind the kelir and be the dalang.

13
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:30.722
Any child can tell a story in Indonesian, Javanese or English.

14
00:01:30.722 --> 00:01:34.109
Tap a story starter, or just talk.

15
00:01:34.109 --> 00:01:35.560
Nothing to type.

16
00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.573
Six Meta models work as one troupe,

17
00:01:39.573 --> 00:01:42.745
and you can watch them on stage.

18
00:01:42.745 --> 00:01:46.371
Muse Voice Transcribe listens, Muse Spark 1.2 hears

19
00:01:46.371 --> 00:01:49.997
Javanese, and Muse Spark 1.3 writes the lakon.

20
00:01:49.997 --> 00:01:54.983
The Penjaga Budaya agent checks every scene against its cultural rules.

21
00:01:54.983 --> 00:02:00.421
Muse Image carves each puppet once and SAM 3.1 cuts it out.

22
00:02:00.421 --> 00:02:04.047
Muse Wonder plans every move, and the Dalang

23
00:02:04.047 --> 00:02:07.220
Director sets the camera and the gamelan.

24
00:02:07.933 --> 00:02:09.717
It checks its own work.

25
00:02:09.717 --> 00:02:13.999
A vision agent redraws any picture that breaks the script, and every

26
00:02:13.999 --> 00:02:17.923
film shows its trace and a receipt for every model call.

27
00:02:21.967 --> 00:02:25.361
Read-along captions light up each word as it's spoken.

28
00:02:25.361 --> 00:02:28.379
Share the film to the Pentas wall, and

29
00:02:28.379 --> 00:02:31.397
the puppets turn into a WhatsApp sticker pack.

30
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.950
Print the puppets and the storybook, grab a

31
00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:43.900
torch, and the show moves off the screen.

32
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:46.891
Dalang AI.

33
00:02:46.891 --> 00:02:50.011
A child tells a story out loud,

34
00:02:50.011 --> 00:02:52.686
and six Meta models perform it.

35
00:02:52.686 --> 00:02:55.360
Every child can be a dalang.
